ounty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025 that pair ran 26% of normal on the middle, and January to February ran 27%. Grid 24457 had its driest year in 1988 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
